            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.16.0

- Music fades in and out when you play or pause.
- Music pauses when your Mac locks or sleeps, and resumes when you come back.
- The widget hides during calls, and any Focus can now hide it too.
- Save songs to your library with the new heart on the widget.
- Full screen lyrics light up under your pointer, and the widget picks up the album's color.
]]></description>
